      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">setBeanFactory</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
